    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d200">

                <pb facs="0300" n="184" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg184"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.00/2388.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Hale to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 52.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">San José</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-12-31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 31, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report as follows:</p>
                <p>In my No. 51 of December 25 I gave the text of the communication which, in
                    accordance with the Department’s instructions, I had presented to the President
                    of Costa Rica; and also the text of his reply (through the Foreign Office).</p>
                <p>On yesterday I received Department’s telegram of December 29; and herein enclose
                    copy of my note in accordance therewith, of December 30, to the Foreign
                    Office.</p>
                <p>I venture to express the hope that President Gonzalez will now continue in the
                    friendly state of mind towards Mr. Bryan and our Government with which Mr.
                    Bryan’s letter to me of July 24 last had inspired him.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d200-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">E. J. Hale</hi></signed>.</closer>



                <xi:include href="d200-a1.xml" xpointer="d200-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d200-f1" n="2" xml:id="d200-f1-content">
                <p>See Nicaragua: Proposed interoceanic canal treaty, etc.</p>
            </note>
